WEBVTT

00:11.545 --> 00:15.174
Hanaukyo Maid Team

00:15.549 --> 00:21.510
Asa no mado wo aketanara.

00:21.588 --> 00:28.152
Hikari no hana
sekai wo tsutsumu.

00:29.196 --> 00:35.101
Mune no naka ni nemutte iru...

00:35.168 --> 00:41.971
...omoi ga ima tokete ikuyou.

00:43.176 --> 00:48.113
Kisetsu no nioi dakishimeteru.

00:49.549 --> 00:55.784
Anata ni negatte...

00:55.856 --> 00:58.825
Aitakatta...

00:58.892 --> 01:02.623
...umareta hi kara zutto.

01:02.696 --> 01:05.529
Anata hitori...

01:05.599 --> 01:09.968
...mamoritai hito ga iru.

01:10.037 --> 01:12.301
Anata dake...

01:12.372 --> 01:14.465
...furetai.

01:15.709 --> 01:20.737
Kono te wo tsunaguno.

01:22.482 --> 01:24.211
Todoketai.

01:25.852 --> 01:28.047
Voice of my heart.

02:01.922 --> 02:02.911
Fenrir-chan.

02:22.476 --> 02:27.379
True Smile

02:43.530 --> 02:45.498
Oh, Taro-sama.

02:45.565 --> 02:47.465
You're daring.

02:49.469 --> 02:51.903
Please push more!

02:51.972 --> 02:52.996
No, hey...

02:53.073 --> 02:55.769
Then please rub it.

02:56.443 --> 02:57.705
- Marron.
- Marron.

03:00.213 --> 03:02.545
Let me join in, join in, too!

03:02.616 --> 03:04.743
I want to rub, rub, too!

03:04.818 --> 03:07.013
Rub, rub, rub!

03:08.922 --> 03:11.482
Good morning, Taro-sama.

03:12.092 --> 03:13.491
Morning...

03:14.361 --> 03:15.487
Oh?

03:17.664 --> 03:20.189
Then let me go over
today's schedule.

03:20.267 --> 03:22.030
Following the morning walk...

03:22.102 --> 03:24.195
...breakfast till 8 o'clock.

03:24.271 --> 03:27.104
Afterwards, please
engage in official business.

03:27.174 --> 03:29.904
Security will give
a status report today.

03:29.976 --> 03:32.672
Wardrobe will fit you
for new formal wear.

03:32.746 --> 03:36.648
Finance will report this
quarter's financial index.

03:40.687 --> 03:42.348
Grace. Good morning.

03:43.089 --> 03:44.215
H-Hi.

03:46.026 --> 03:47.459
Going to bed now?

03:47.527 --> 03:48.994
Something like that.

03:50.030 --> 03:51.258
You have something?

03:51.331 --> 03:53.196
S-Shut up.

03:53.266 --> 03:54.233
Go away.

03:55.335 --> 03:56.563
Then good night.

03:56.636 --> 03:57.967
Yeah, bye.

04:05.111 --> 04:06.169
W-Wait!

04:08.982 --> 04:10.040
This...

04:10.116 --> 04:11.981
What's next?

04:15.722 --> 04:17.349
D-Don't misunderstand!

04:17.424 --> 04:20.791
This is because Cynthia
asked me to teach her...

04:27.300 --> 04:29.928
Let's see... Like this and this.

04:30.003 --> 04:30.970
I see...

04:32.205 --> 04:33.229
Then this?

04:34.074 --> 04:36.269
Let me see... Like this.

04:36.343 --> 04:38.140
I-I see...

04:42.482 --> 04:43.779
Well, see you later.

04:43.850 --> 04:45.181
Yes.

04:48.855 --> 04:49.822
Oh?

04:56.196 --> 05:00.098
I don't know why, but I feel
like it has been a long time.

05:00.166 --> 05:02.691
Since I've had a morning
like this with you.

05:06.806 --> 05:07.932
Mariel...

05:09.175 --> 05:11.803
Everything is
the same as usual...

05:11.878 --> 05:13.937
...but I feel very warm somehow.

05:15.615 --> 05:17.606
It's funny, isn't it?

05:17.684 --> 05:19.481
It's not funny.

06:03.630 --> 06:04.722
There.

06:11.438 --> 06:12.405
Come in.

06:14.541 --> 06:16.202
Good morning.

06:16.276 --> 06:17.243
Morning.

06:17.310 --> 06:21.178
This is the mansion's
security status since yesterday.

06:21.247 --> 06:22.214
Please review it.

06:23.583 --> 06:26.381
If you didn't find any
problems, it should be fine.

06:26.453 --> 06:28.216
That will not do.

06:31.858 --> 06:33.450
Taro-sama.

06:33.526 --> 06:35.221
I understand...

06:49.709 --> 06:51.233
What will you do?

06:55.615 --> 06:57.947
The same as before.

07:01.421 --> 07:02.388
I see.

07:07.560 --> 07:09.960
It's a nice day, isn't it?

09:17.223 --> 09:20.090
It's no use hiding, Cynthia-chan.

09:21.294 --> 09:22.090
Oh?

09:28.902 --> 09:30.096
Cynthia-chan!

09:41.915 --> 09:43.815
Did you learn from Grace-chan?

09:53.359 --> 09:54.326
My...

09:55.361 --> 09:56.328
Mariel!

09:57.997 --> 09:58.827
Taro-sama.

10:00.233 --> 10:01.632
So you were here.

10:01.701 --> 10:04.932
I was playing cat's cradle
with Cynthia-chan.

10:08.975 --> 10:10.203
Say, Mariel...

10:11.077 --> 10:14.046
Do I have any schedules
planned for this afternoon?

10:14.113 --> 10:16.445
No, nothing special...

10:16.516 --> 10:17.881
I see.

10:17.951 --> 10:20.249
I want to go out for a bit...

10:21.287 --> 10:22.515
Is it all right?

10:22.589 --> 10:23.556
Yes.

10:24.424 --> 10:26.415
If you'd like to.

10:26.492 --> 10:28.653
Then I'll tell Konoe-san, too.

10:29.829 --> 10:30.818
Um...

10:32.098 --> 10:33.622
Um...

10:33.700 --> 10:35.327
Shall I help you get ready?

10:36.202 --> 10:38.966
I'm all right. I can do it myself.

10:39.038 --> 10:40.835
You relax, Mariel.

10:42.842 --> 10:43.968
All right...

10:44.043 --> 10:45.670
See you.

10:45.745 --> 10:47.235
Um, Taro-sama.

10:48.882 --> 10:50.850
May I come with you?

10:52.185 --> 10:54.346
Sure. Let's go together.

10:55.855 --> 10:56.913
Yes...

10:56.990 --> 11:01.893
Hanaukyo Maid Team

11:02.862 --> 11:05.456
I won't let you go anymore, Yashima.

11:05.531 --> 11:06.930
Konoe-shama.

11:07.000 --> 11:08.558
Such soft skin.

11:08.635 --> 11:10.330
Yours too, Konoe-shama.

11:10.403 --> 11:13.702
- It makes me want to eat it.
- Oh, my body!

11:13.773 --> 11:15.400
My body's going to melt!

11:16.676 --> 11:18.439
I'm melting...

11:18.511 --> 11:19.739
I'm melted...

11:20.647 --> 11:21.614
How is it?

11:21.681 --> 11:26.084
Virtual Delusion-kun's power of
imaging delusions in your head?

11:26.152 --> 11:27.779
Konoe-shama, I love you!

11:28.855 --> 11:31.585
Yashima, call me Big Sister.

11:31.658 --> 11:34.786
No, I'm too embarrassed to say it.

11:34.861 --> 11:36.658
Say it, or I'll stop.

11:36.729 --> 11:38.993
Konoe-shama, you're mean...

11:39.065 --> 11:40.999
It's not Konoe-shama.

11:41.067 --> 11:42.898
B-Big Sister...

11:42.969 --> 11:43.833
Big...

11:44.003 --> 11:45.265
Virtual Delusion-kun
Trial Version

11:47.140 --> 11:48.300
Huh?

11:48.374 --> 11:51.366
That's the end since
it's a trial version.

11:51.444 --> 11:54.572
If you want to continue,
sign this application.

11:55.615 --> 11:58.982
Now an unlimited version
upgrade application...

11:59.052 --> 12:01.577
...and an Ikuyossie
magazine subscription.

12:01.654 --> 12:06.182
Sign this permit to allow
website access at the equator.

12:06.259 --> 12:07.453
Is that it?

12:07.527 --> 12:09.119
Then please enjoy it.

12:09.195 --> 12:11.720
Oh, Konoe-shama...

12:11.798 --> 12:12.822
She's easy.

12:32.819 --> 12:35.185
Taro-sama, are you all right?

12:35.254 --> 12:36.744
Thank you.

12:36.823 --> 12:39.257
You dry off too,
or you'll catch a cold.

12:39.325 --> 12:40.986
No, I am...

12:41.060 --> 12:42.049
That won't do.

12:42.128 --> 12:43.186
Taro-sama...

13:22.235 --> 13:23.634
It's not stopping...

13:26.205 --> 13:30.471
If it's all right, shall I ask someone
from the mansion to come?

13:31.511 --> 13:33.479
If you tell me the place...

13:33.546 --> 13:34.945
No, it's fine.

13:36.582 --> 13:39.050
I want to go by myself
and have a talk.

13:39.952 --> 13:41.078
Talk?

13:41.154 --> 13:42.485
Yeah.

14:05.178 --> 14:07.237
Elder Sister...

14:07.313 --> 14:11.773
Ever since I parted from you and
the others, I've always wondered.

14:11.851 --> 14:13.250
If this was good.

14:13.319 --> 14:15.310
If this was correct.

14:15.388 --> 14:18.516
But I will not doubt anymore.

14:20.560 --> 14:22.289
Konoe-shama...

14:27.533 --> 14:30.991
Next is the two of us in
the gym storage room...

14:31.070 --> 14:32.298
Yashima?

14:32.371 --> 14:35.499
Oh, Konoe-shama
in a gym uniform!

14:35.575 --> 14:37.634
I love you very much!

14:38.144 --> 14:39.236
Hey, what are you doing?

14:40.113 --> 14:41.205
Konoe-shama!

14:41.280 --> 14:42.907
What is this?

14:42.982 --> 14:45.007
Leader... That's a, well, um...

14:50.523 --> 14:52.616
Why you.
I'm going to kiss you.

14:52.692 --> 14:54.284
Kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss!

14:56.295 --> 14:57.353
Konoe-shama...

14:57.430 --> 15:00.024
Whoa-ho, you prefer this type of dog.

15:01.634 --> 15:02.828
Ow...

15:02.902 --> 15:04.392
Why me?

15:17.717 --> 15:19.708
It's slippery, so watch out.

15:19.785 --> 15:20.752
Right.

15:22.889 --> 15:24.083
Taro-sama!

15:26.659 --> 15:28.251
Are you all right?

15:30.663 --> 15:31.755
It's the same.

15:33.633 --> 15:36.261
As when we first met.

15:37.570 --> 15:38.537
Yes.

15:45.311 --> 15:46.744
Ouch...

15:47.446 --> 15:48.572
Mariel...

16:13.573 --> 16:14.562
This is...

16:14.640 --> 16:17.541
Hanaukyo Family Grave

16:22.048 --> 16:23.811
Wait just a bit.

16:23.883 --> 16:24.907
I'll be quick.

16:25.785 --> 16:26.877
Taro-sama...

16:43.569 --> 16:46.129
Thanks for waiting.
Shall we go?

16:46.205 --> 16:47.934
Are you done already?

16:48.007 --> 16:49.304
Yeah.

16:55.781 --> 16:56.748
Taro-sama.

17:00.119 --> 17:01.814
What's the matter?

17:01.887 --> 17:04.412
Um, I...

17:04.490 --> 17:08.586
I troubled you and everyone else.

17:08.661 --> 17:10.856
I made you worry and suffer...

17:11.897 --> 17:13.728
But...

17:13.799 --> 17:14.891
Mariel...

17:14.967 --> 17:16.400
What...

17:17.937 --> 17:19.871
...should I do?

17:23.609 --> 17:25.270
It's a big tree, isn't it?

17:33.819 --> 17:36.947
I didn't notice there
was one like this till now...

17:37.023 --> 17:39.287
...even though it's so nice and big.

17:40.359 --> 17:43.021
I think there are
many things like that.

17:43.095 --> 17:44.619
Taro-sama...

17:44.697 --> 17:47.723
Missing an important thing
in front of your eyes...

17:47.800 --> 17:50.860
...or not realizing
an answer right beside you.

17:51.971 --> 17:54.804
Let's find them together
one by one from now on.

17:55.841 --> 17:57.741
I think we can find many things.

17:58.778 --> 18:02.373
Landscapes never seen
before or new worlds...

18:03.749 --> 18:05.410
Someone else's feelings...

18:05.484 --> 18:06.849
One's own heart...

18:08.154 --> 18:10.247
And true smiles.

18:11.524 --> 18:12.491
All right.

18:33.346 --> 18:39.046
Asa no mado wo aketanara.

18:39.118 --> 18:45.751
Hikari no hana
sekai wo tsutsumu.

18:46.792 --> 18:52.628
Mune no naka ni nemutte iru...

18:52.698 --> 18:59.365
...omoi ga ima tokete ikuyou.

19:00.873 --> 19:05.901
Sagashite ita shinjitsu te...

19:07.079 --> 19:13.348
...kono te ni arumono.

19:13.419 --> 19:16.354
Aitakatta...

19:16.422 --> 19:20.153
...umareta hi kara zutto.

19:20.226 --> 19:23.024
Anata hitori...

19:23.095 --> 19:27.532
...mamoritai hito ga iru.

19:27.600 --> 19:29.830
Anata dake...

19:29.902 --> 19:33.201
...furetai.

19:33.272 --> 19:38.403
Kono te wo tsunaguno.

19:40.012 --> 19:41.741
Todoketai.

19:43.249 --> 19:45.979
Voice of my heart.

19:47.219 --> 19:53.954
Itsumo soba de
mitsumeru sono yokogao...

19:54.026 --> 19:56.893
Egao dake de...

19:56.962 --> 20:01.558
...watashi wa shiawase yo.

20:01.634 --> 20:03.659
Donna toki mo...

20:03.736 --> 20:12.371
...anata no nozomi wo kikasete.

20:13.879 --> 20:16.040
Voice of your heart.

20:18.417 --> 20:19.543
I'm back!

20:20.119 --> 20:21.552
R-Ryuka-san.

20:22.354 --> 20:23.844
What's that outfit?

20:23.923 --> 20:28.087
Taro Hanaukyo, I'm making
a formal offer. Be my groom!

20:28.160 --> 20:29.855
Aren't you cold?

20:31.130 --> 20:34.827
How do you think I'm feeling
when wearing a dress like this?

20:34.900 --> 20:36.731
Dense, dense, dense.

20:36.802 --> 20:38.793
You don't get anything at all...

20:41.907 --> 20:43.033
My!

20:50.583 --> 20:51.948
I-It's no mistake.

20:52.017 --> 20:54.110
This was inevitable.

20:54.186 --> 20:56.120
Ryuka-san!

20:56.822 --> 20:59.086
- Us too!
- Kiss, kiss!

20:59.158 --> 21:01.626
Taro-sama!

21:01.694 --> 21:03.321
Smooch, smooch, smooch!

21:03.395 --> 21:04.157
Taro!

21:06.599 --> 21:08.692
Wait, Taro-sama isn't here.

21:08.767 --> 21:10.200
What?

21:10.269 --> 21:11.827
Where did you go?

21:11.904 --> 21:15.101
- Taro-sama!
- Taro-sama!

21:36.161 --> 21:37.355
Mom...

21:37.429 --> 21:38.623
I've realized.

21:39.532 --> 21:42.831
It's not true that Mariel
doesn't have any feelings.

21:42.902 --> 21:47.498
I'm sure that Mariel has
true feelings and a true smile.

21:49.375 --> 21:50.501
That's why...

22:01.253 --> 22:04.552
Warera ni omakase kudasai.

22:04.623 --> 22:06.784
Hanaukyo Maid Tai.

22:07.793 --> 22:10.956
Osewa sasete itadakimasu.

22:11.030 --> 22:14.124
Osoba goyo tai.

22:14.199 --> 22:17.293
Oki ni mesuyouni tsuneni.

22:17.369 --> 22:19.599
Yaruki runrun nandesu.

22:20.639 --> 22:23.802
Kokoro to karada wo migaki.

22:23.876 --> 22:26.811
Goyou nannarito.

22:26.879 --> 22:38.484
Yorokonde yorokonde
hoshii dake desu.

22:39.625 --> 22:50.126
Sorenanoni sorenanoni
tsurenai ohito.

22:52.371 --> 22:58.503
Hoshiga hora kirei desu.

22:58.577 --> 23:04.174
Asu mo hare deshou.

23:05.217 --> 23:11.520
Konya mone yume demone...

23:11.590 --> 23:15.890
...osewa shichau.
